</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Plasma_Fire\" title=\"Personal Plasma Fire\">Personal Plasma Fire</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Photoionization\" title=\"Photoionization\">Photoionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermal_Ionization\" title=\"Thermal Ionization\">Thermal Ionization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Power Augmentation\">Power Augmentation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Power_Augmentation\" title=\"Self-Power Augmentation\">Self-Power Augmentation</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Attacks\" title=\"Solar Attacks\">Solar Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Infusion\" title=\"Solar Infusion\">Solar Infusion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Empowerment\" title=\"Solar Empowerment\">Solar Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Vision\" title=\"Electromagnetic Vision\">Electromagnetic Vision</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thermoreception\" title=\"Thermoreception\">Thermoreception</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Restoration\" title=\"Self-Restoration\">Self-Restoration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Body\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Supernatural Body\">Supernatural Body</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Accumulation\" title=\"Solar Accumulation\">Solar Accumulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Concentration\" title=\"Solar Concentration\">Solar Concentration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Conversion\" title=\"Solar Conversion\">Solar Conversion</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Solar_Energizing\" title=\"Solar Energizing\">Solar Energizing</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Cells\" title=\"Supernatural Cells\">Supernatural Cells</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Fanon:Superhuman_Physical_Abilities\" title=\"Fanon:Superhuman Physical Abilities\">Superhuman Physical Abilities</a></li>\n<li><a href=\